  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The novel names human path as a path with Immortal Gu, killer moves, dao marks, and attainment, rather than as a loose label for ordinary people.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Old Man Yan Shi speaks of his own attainment in human path when comparing his Pure Dream Reality Seeker Physique with Ren Zu’s ten extreme physiques, saying his human path cannot compare to Ren Zu.",
      "chapters": [
        1002
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "early-named-attainment",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_old_man_yan_shi",
        "sys_pure_dream_reality_seeker_physique",
        "char_ren_zu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Human path’s specialty is in support, because human path dao marks will not interrupt other paths’ dao marks or conflict with them. Heavenly Court’s human path killer move that sheds white lights cannot be cleared without human path methods of at least rank eight.",
      "chapters": [
        1729
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "support-specialty",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After enough life experience, Fang Yuan gains human path inspiration and modifies the mortal killer move myriad self until it progresses into a human path killer move. Myriad self Immortal Gu is confirmed as a human path Immortal Gu. Perseverance Gu and sovereign immortal fetus Gu are also human path Gu worms. Hope Gu, vanity Gu, guts Gu, stubborn Gu, pride Gu, self Gu, and suffering Gu in The Legends of Ren Zu are likewise human path Gu. The Legends of Ren Zu is known as the human path true inheritance and contains deep profundities of the path. He summarizes that a person’s life is their exploration toward human path itself.",
      "chapters": [
        1774
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "true-inheritance-and-gu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "gu_myriad_self_immortal_gu",
        "gu_perseverance_gu",
        "gu_sovereign_immortal_fetus_gu",
        "sys_gu_worms",
        "gu_hope_gu",
        "gu_vanity_gu",
        "gu_guts_gu",
        "gu_pride_gu",
        "gu_self_gu",
        "gu_suffering_gu",
        "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Divine Emperor City’s painting world, human path Gu worms include cheap beggar Gu with low battle strength, while the ten children of human path maintain human path Gu worms with primeval essence as Gu Masters. Beggar Sect grows quickly from such Gu and from native beggars, but remains weak against merchants, guards, and similar foes unless numbers unite.",
      "chapters": [
        2082
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "human-path-gu-worms",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_divine_emperor_city",
        "gu_beggar_gu",
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "fac_beggar_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Venerables’ immense innate luck mostly comes from two sources: the favor of heaven’s will, and the adoration of human path. Red Lotus Demon Venerable is named the best example of human path adoration. Human path methods are a good way of breaking through the Heavenly Dao blockade, and the various venerables share a trait of comprehending something from The Legends of Ren Zu and creating their own top tier human path killer moves.",
      "chapters": [
        2085
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "adoration-and-heavenly-dao",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_red_lotus_demon_venerable",
        "sys_heavenly_dao"
      ]
    }
